# `yo fix <path> --migrate markers` inserts decision 33's call-site markers
# (plans/VALUES_BY_DEFAULT.md V3b Generation B): `&x` on a bare named place
# passed to a `&T` parameter, `&mut x` on one passed to a `&mut T` parameter.
# Receivers, temporaries, operator operands, borrow bindings passed whole
# (`relay`'s `s`/`xs`), by-value, compile-time parameters and an argument
# already marked stay as written. The expected_tree pins the rewritten
# main.yo; the trailing strict `check` proves no bare site is left.
stdout_keep=^fix:
timeout=180
env=YO_STRICT_MARKERS=1
